            <description><![CDATA[<p>Automatic sync and clearer notebook controls. Keep notes up to date when Shan opens, wakes, or reconnects, with automatic retries for temporary connection failures. View sync details and Agent errors from a simpler notebook menu, and use consistent note actions. Preserve custom reference labels. Model settings now show clear loading stages and recover from cloud timeouts. Requires an Apple Silicon Mac running macOS 26 or later. This beta has not been notarized by Apple.</p>]]></description>
